{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord: rkdp2fr3qv</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow YouTube account: ZYI Game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious force found you to sign a contract because of your potential, hoping that you will perform the Swarm  hunting mission and provide the power of the contract to help you become stronger. You can increase basic attributes through the power of the contract, or you can purchase props, skills, ammunition, etc. through the contract points to improve your combat effectiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.poster.avif?t=1764919150\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.webm?t=1764919150\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/a195a4aa152ebda6cf3beab291778423.mp4?t=1764919150\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>1. Magic Chariot &amp; Light Inventory Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's right\u2014you pilot a <strong>Chariot</strong>! A majestic chariot always gives us more security. Fill your equipment slots with weapons and items and pour your firepower onto the enemy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One point to note: our game demands more focus on <strong>build strategy</strong>. You'll need to figure out the best combinations within limited gear slots to ensure the most comfortable combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/25d867b609e0e264fecd6dac0458533c.avif?t=1764919150\" width=1560 height=872 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/925da94222e9e3e21796be813b6968af.avif?t=1764919150\" width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2. Style Route Selection</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To enhance strategic depth, we've added a <strong>Route Map</strong> mechanic. You can choose paths rich with Elites, challenging higher difficulty for better economy; or you can opt for routes with more Encounters and Treasures, reducing combat difficulty while relying on luck to gain more resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/f52b7acacc6fb8ff6e73b105e442b23d.avif?t=1764919150\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>3. Abundant Synthesis Recipes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Besides directly purchasing higher-tier items, you can also synthesize new gear by consuming <strong>2 to 4 lower-tier items</strong>! Furthermore, you can use <strong>Mutated Runes</strong> for a chance to transform low-level items directly into higher-tier ones through luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3270580/extras/78caf6d0d1f84231e2408176776b1fac.avif?t=1764919150\" width=1560 height=860 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>4. Deep Build Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through smart combinations, you can craft devastating, infinitely powerful builds, such as the <strong>Endless Lightning Ball Stream</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co